{{- /*
  Path-level redirects only. Cloudflare matches `source` against the path,
  never the hostname, so the www -> apex redirect lives in a zone Single
  Redirect rule instead. See README.md, section Deploy.
*/ -}}
# Feed aliases: /index.xml is the canonical location.
/feed /index.xml 301
/rss /index.xml 301
/feed.xml /index.xml 301
